# ruflo (claude-flow) runtime state, added 2026-08-06.
# The vector store and swarm scratch are per-machine runtime data, not config.
# .claude-flow/{data,logs,sessions} are already covered above.
ruvector.db
ruvector.db-*
.swarm/
.claude-flow/metrics/

# Claude Code guidance: local-only. These describe how to work in this repo on
# this machine, not how the app is built, so they stay out of the shared history.
# frontend/CLAUDE.md is regenerated by `next dev` on every run, which otherwise
# leaves the tree permanently dirty.
CLAUDE.md
frontend/CLAUDE.md
